# Skills

This directory contains the set of skills I want to include across all code sessions. Most skills are sourced from other authors; attribution can be traced via the skills-lock.json file.

Some skills have been slightly modified to behave my liking.

## Workflow

Update the skills with

```sh
pnpm skills:sync
```

Review the changes, then commit and push the desired final state.

## Installing

```sh
./install.sh
```

Run from the repo root. It installs the team skills listed in `skill-sources.txt`, then this directory, so a skill here overrides a team skill with the same name. It also symlinks `omp/AGENTS.md`, `omp/agents/`, and `sandbox-projects/` into place. Rerunning it is safe.

## Contributing

Add a new external skill to this repo by adding it to the project with `pnpx skills@latest add`, then by running `pnpm skills:sync`. For pstack, add from `https://github.com/cursor/plugins/tree/main/pstack` so the lock records `pstack/skills/...`, not the Claude Code copies.
